{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "74f280da3e752fe4f631789d842a961f6b9acde55eb35fdbeb7a6b957c9a507e", "ja": "（今度のイベントステージに向けて、\n杏奈は一生懸命、ベースを弾く練習をしている）", "zh": "（为了接下来的活动舞台，杏奈正在努力练习弹贝斯）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "b9a7e252fe6c55971438ab5e0b3c8b3dfa548d816660c12edf25faaa99771ff2", "ja": "ふぅ……ちょっと、休憩……。\nベース……けっこう、難しい……。", "zh": "呼……稍微休息一下……  \n贝斯……还挺难的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "73597f06cfe2cff7b15cfcf1a01b561fc1e6a8e716da9087d547dce3a7441db5", "ja": "杏奈、お疲れさま。\nベース、いい感じに弾けてたじゃないか。", "zh": "杏奈，辛苦了。\n贝斯弹得不是挺好的吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "39f6e30076bbc232a16de4b83a8584c74ac6ff5b6e2304ddafa7f50d996462eb", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nでも、杏奈……まだ、失敗……する……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n不过，杏奈……还是会……失败……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1004_p", "source_sha256": "57a3710a895f9d82c1f599db49176f3ef4071c12db969d7d74aaeb866f0ace03", "ja": "そうなのか？　上手く弾けてたと思うけど……\nそれに、すごく楽しそうに見えたよ。", "zh": "是这样吗？我觉得你弹得挺好的……\n而且，看起来特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "655fe387d750f019d54e220c2c804c9c52f310ff07342f91329c1034df0a99e7", "ja": "それは……杏奈の、好きなゲームの曲……だから。\n演奏するのは……すごく、楽しかった……です。", "zh": "那是……杏奈喜欢的游戏里的曲子……所以。\n演奏起来……真的，非常开心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1006_p", "source_sha256": "839b31aa16514892a7ac64082ba5dd382e2caab656ec380441f257311070931c", "ja": "ああ、なるほど……\nそれで頑張って練習してたのか。", "zh": "啊，原来如此……\n所以才那么努力练习啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "e1f104abc25c24784824906e887fb894218389b0207d61cecaeed4e30483ba03", "ja": "うん……素敵な曲、だから……。\nもっと、うまく……弾けるように、なりたい……。", "zh": "嗯……因为是……很棒的曲子……\n想要弹得……更加……好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "74e52764123b3c62c7b8a649b2b54a14fe1ac7cd24581cac12d6daca132ddf73", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nどうしたら……上手に、できる……かな……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n要怎样……才能做得更好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1009_p", "source_sha256": "320b241a6ca1c2842ba706be285330862c45af83501a1214af77b4cef62c80b8", "ja": "もう十分上手だと思うけど……\n後は、杏奈が自信を持つだけじゃないか？", "zh": "我觉得你已经做得够好了……\n接下来只要杏奈有自信就行了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f8b299fbfa05c07b1001bef7dcf7cf5a4130ff76831a5f6089602f0d7421b101", "ja": "ベースは、バンドの屋台骨とも言うだろ。\n派手ではないけど、大事なポジションなんだよ。", "zh": "贝斯也可以说是乐队的支柱吧。\n虽然不够华丽，但可是很重要的位置。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "ba69e816908154c61ad2339e1cf7c22db048689bb45171144395b39868c7070f", "ja": "派手じゃないけど、大事……ベースは、バフ役……？\nみんなを……サポート、する……。", "zh": "虽然不华丽，却很重要……贝斯，是负责提供增益的角色……？\n支持着……大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3f9e993381a12297b12f8fbbe81805ebfb93982193f28b9a3b42cce1e3c29fcb", "ja": "バフ役か、うん、いいじゃないか。\n杏奈は自分がバフ役の時、どうしてる？", "zh": "担任增益辅助啊，嗯，不错嘛。\n杏奈在担任增益辅助时，会怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "1d6220a7cca4eccc274bef24d60565687bb9ba8efb84e11d18bcb7fb87ea5a7d", "ja": "バフ役の時は……みんなをよく見て、\nタイミングを合わせて……バフをかける……よ……。", "zh": "当增益位时……会仔细观察大家，\n配合时机……施加增益……哦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "fb15879b48442e02cd7204691f2c7c5fcae9529d522d2c040c96f1bb652553e0", "ja": "バフ役は、ひとりだと、弱いけど……。\nみんながいれば……すごく、強い……。", "zh": "当增益手的时候，一个人会很弱，但是……\n只要大家在一起……就会变得非常强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "8554799d17432b69da3402c1e2b859738db4941fa3a8a182efa23f77e5dd1265", "ja": "そっか……バンドも、ひとりじゃないから……\nみんなで、音を合わせて……みんなで、上手に……。", "zh": "这样啊……乐队也不是一个人，所以……\n大家一起合奏……大家一起，演奏得很好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5dff9bc82ea1d436d1e3d6e73672aee5ebb19d0de94f96844ed15e006aa1ae71", "ja": "ああ。だから、不安に思わなくても大丈夫だ。\nみんなと一緒に楽しめば、きっと上手くいくよ。", "zh": "嗯。所以不用担心。\n只要和大家一起享受其中，一定会顺利的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "0dbc1e66efb535b1596bfbdfdb1ad40c122f4a5055cd2fb6d638e0d6f455cd45", "ja": "うん……わかった。\n{$P$}さん、ありがとう……です。", "zh": "嗯……我知道了。\n{$P$}先生，谢谢……你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "f4242847d5ae07dc1cb567f4a1ad25e7563d9ac8ad2d5a5a783b8d14b4acab8e", "ja": "みんなと一緒に、バンドやるの……楽しみ……。\n杏奈……がんばり、ます……♪", "zh": "和大家一起组乐队……好期待……\n杏奈……会努力的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0133_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f4490d8c086abf2d832a164905a17c273784bb38bcdd292a2e6f64bc814e2bd8", "ja": "（表情が明るくなった……\n杏奈のベースは、皆を支えてくれるに違いない）", "zh": "（她的表情变得明朗起来了……杏奈的贝斯一定能支撑起大家吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
